            <mi>m</mi>
          </mrow>
        </msup>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle {\text{Rate}}=k\cdot [{\ce {A}}]^{n}\cdot [{\ce {B}}]^{m}}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/987ad15205adeaf01439477a204ca184e41bf7c9" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.838ex; width:21.348ex; height:2.843ex;" alt="{\displaystyle {\text{Rate}}=k\cdot [{\ce {A}}]^{n}\cdot [{\ce {B}}]^{m}}"></span></dd></dl>
<p>where <span class="texhtml mvar" style="font-style:italic;">n</span> is the reaction order of <span class="texhtml">A</span>, <span class="texhtml mvar" style="font-style:italic;">m</span> is the reaction order of <span class="texhtml">B</span>, <span class="texhtml mvar" style="font-style:italic;">n + m</span> is the reaction order of the full reaction, and <span class="texhtml mvar" style="font-style:italic;">k</span> is the reaction constant.
</p>
